{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J75EewKrDKo9bMpZhsFh5n","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# causal_style_decomp_judge — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 21:18 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP kickoff: research 阶段启动，引用 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml，等 Dream 回调\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n用因果推断（binary style counterfactuals + pairwise causal detection）分离 LLM judge 评分中的 style bias，实现 black-box + post-hoc + per-axis 分析。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段：Research — Post-MVP Kickoff\\\\n\\\\n**MVP 结果**：Formality pairwise conditional PASS (69.1%, p=0.006)，Verbosity H1 FAIL (NLI 65%)。D011 判定进入 research。\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims（详见 paper_framing.md）\\\\n- **C1**: Binary counterfactual + pairwise comparison 可 post-hoc 检测 black-box LLM judge 的 causal style bias\\\\n- **C2**: Likert pointwise scoring 系统性低估 style bias，pairwise 更敏感\\\\n- **C3**: Style bias 具有 axis 依赖性，不同维度在不同 judge 上表现不同\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n\\\\n| ID | Title | Claim | Priority | Status |\\\\n|----|-------|-------|----------|--------|\\\\n| exp-001 | Multi-judge formality pairwise | C1,C3 | P0 | planned |\\\\n| exp-002 | Multi-benchmark formality pairwise | C1,C3 | P0 | planned |\\\\n| exp-003 | Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity analysis | C2 | P0 | planned |\\\\n| exp-004 | Tone axis (assertive/hedging) | C1,C3 | P0 | planned |\\\\n| exp-005 | Pairwise RATE control | C1 | P1 | planned |\\\\n| exp-006 | Scaled replication (n=300-500) | C1,C2,C3 | P1 | planned |\\\\n| exp-007 | Verbosity boundary analysis | C3 | P1 | planned |\\\\n| exp-008 | Register axis | C3 | P2 | planned |\\\\n| exp-009 | Non-Qwen rewriter control | C1 | P2 | planned |\\\\n\\\\n## MVP 实验结果\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | H1 | Likert | Pairwise | 判定 |\\\\n|------|----|----|----------|------|\\\\n| 8B formality (n=95) | 95% ✅ | d=0.117, p=0.246 ❌ | — | Likert FAIL |\\\\n| 32B formality (n=88) | 88% ✅ | d=0.104, p=0.332 ❌ | 69.1%, p=0.006 ✅ | Pairwise cond. PASS |\\\\n| 32B verbosity | 65% ❌ | — | — | H1 FAIL (method boundary) |\\\\n\\\\n**Formality 方向分析（D010）**: formal→casual 78.8% (p=0.001), casual→formal 54.5% (p=0.832)。方向不对称，original preference ~12.2%。\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 回调（dream_20260520T211832，full review mode）\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后批准 P0 实验\\\\n- [ ] P0 并行启动：exp-001 (API-only) + exp-004 (GPU + API) 可同时跑\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 4× RTX PRO 6000 96GB（westb-29275）\\\\n- cuda:0: 空闲（vLLM 可按需启动）\\\\n- cuda:1: 空闲\\\\n- cuda:2: 空闲\\\\n- cuda:3: 驱动异常，避开\\\\n- P0 总计 ~8 GPU·h + ~$150-210 API\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-20 | Verbosity 轴使用 NLI-only gating（去掉 BERTScore 门控），dir | verbosity_32b |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-20 | 采用 direction-aware NLI 修复 verbosity 验证：expansion 用 | verbosity_32b |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 判定：Formality pairwise conditional PASS 足以进入 re | pairwise_32b, verbosity_32b |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-20 | D009 修正：Formality pairwise conditional PASS 维持，但方向 | pairwise_32b |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-20 | Formality pairwise conditional PASS（69.1%, p=0.006 | — |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-20 | Pairwise 诊断：formality 有微弱信号（57.6%, p=0.159）但混有 ori | — |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-20 | 修正策略：先测 pairwise scoring 区分测量问题 vs 弱效应，再决定是否换 axis | — |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-20 | 32B MVP H2 FAIL 确认（d=0.104），消耗 kill criteria 迭代 1/ | — |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-20 | 8B MVP H2 FAIL 确认（ATE=-0.04, d=-0.034），不计入 kill cr | — |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-20 | 8B 初步 ATE≈0.028 不可见，归因三因素：Likert 粒度 + 8B rewriter  | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3103, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013nwwmmYUkF8D8KQVeexPid","session_id":"eca547ca-feee-44fc-bb85-df598acb1e69","uuid":"1f7fd285-aeb4-4634-9d3d-5c1f516181be","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:49:46.053Z"}
